# Ad-hoc manual-testing dumps - not code, regenerated by hitting the API
# locally. If you want the current ones gone from the repo too, `git rm
# --cached` them once; this only stops NEW ones from being committed.
forecast_test*.json
model3_output.json
model_2_input.json
model_7_output.json
riskgraph_test.json
*.joblib.bak

# Per-business trained models (train_model1.py --all-businesses).
# ~534MB of RandomForests, with single files up to 60MB - too large to
# commit, and fully regenerable from the seeded generator plus the
# training script. The metrics table they produce
# (evaluation/model1_per_business_metrics.csv) IS committed; that is the
# actual result. models/ itself - the demo business's artifacts, which
# the API loads at startup - stays tracked.
models/businesses/
.demo_backup/